        "original_id": "5139770a-af8d-54e4-852c-56b592a6f82a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Hires Root Beer, Vernors Ginger Ale\n- People: James Vernor, Charles Elmer Hires\n- Places: Detroit, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania\n- Roles: pharmacist, Quaker\n\nFacts:\n- Vernors Ginger Ale dates to 1866.\n- In 1866, James Vernor created Vernors Ginger Ale in Detroit.\n- Only Vernors Ginger Ale, dating to 1866, is older than Hires Root Beer.\n- Charles Elmer Hires was a Quaker pharmacist from Philadelphia, Pennsylvania.\n- Charles Elmer Hires formulated the eponymous Hires Root Beer beverage.",
